{"ID":"20240513083158-0s34roe","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083158-0s34roe","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083158-0s34roe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151606-9qkuhtt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151606-9qkuhtt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151606-9qkuhtt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:522,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:522\u0026#125;","title":"182","type":"doc","updated":"20240514140619"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513151606-9qkuhtt","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 978px;","id":"20240513151606-9qkuhtt","updated":"20240514140619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：5/7/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"157-2 C, CY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Male"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"39"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/13/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後仍排便不暢，睡眠不安穩，手足仍易冷，皮膚乾癬無變化 心跳有時快（心動悸）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 手足仍易冷，但有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便前二天排便不暢，量不多，排氣增加，第三天排出大量軟便，排空後頓時下腹部輕鬆，今天仍有排便，大便軟。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便中黃，仍有泡沫但量減少。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 睡眠不好，入睡可，但早上3、4點易醒，不易回睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 身體輕鬆，精神尚佳，白天體力還好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 口渴：會，比較想要喝水，喜喝室溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 皮膚乾癬仍在，無變化。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 流汗：有，稍微。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍洪有力，但形已變小"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 癆症之濕"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方同5/7，但大黃改為3錢，並加入蟬蛻及蛇蛻各5分（另包） "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 → 3"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 大黃用二錢，輕輕推身體一下，靠身體自己的力量排出，不要讓他大下。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 桂枝芍藥知母湯因善用麻黃白朮炮附和桂枝，將潛藏在血脈神經裏的濕抓出經由大便排出而不傷血，而除濕需要一段時間。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 患者年紀不高但其血管較粗大，癆症的人吃不胖（羸瘦）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 乾癬用麻杏薏甘湯沒有明顯改善時，用蟬蛻蛇蛻讓皮退掉換新皮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 肺與大腸相表裏，保持排便通暢並加一些攻皮膚的藥，加速皮膚的改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}